Scope note / 适用范围

This MIT licence covers the tutorials (`0_getting_started/` … `5_deployment/`),
the helper scripts in `scripts/`, `configs/`, `docs/` and `showcase/`.

The real-robot deployment sources under `deploy/` are **derived from
`unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_lab`, which is Apache-2.0 licensed**. They are
distributed under Apache-2.0 — see `deploy/LICENSE` and `deploy/NOTICE`.

本 MIT 许可证适用于教程（`0_getting_started/` … `5_deployment/`）、`scripts/`
下的脚本、`configs/`、`docs/`、`showcase/`。`deploy/` 下的真机部署代码派生自
`unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_lab`（Apache-2.0），沿用上游许可证，见
`deploy/LICENSE` 与 `deploy/NOTICE`。
